programs.candidate_requirement:
Hold a Bachelor's or Master's degree with a GPA of 7.0+ (or equivalent);
Are fresh graduates or have less than 2 years of working experience;
Bring a dynamic, curious, and eager-to-learn mindset, paired with a strong collaborative spirit;
Demonstrate a drive for results, supported by effective communication, analytical thinking, and project management skills;
Showcase a proven track record in extracurricular activities or internship experience;
Are excited about mobility opportunities, both domestic and international;
Aspire to lead and thrive in the fast-paced, ever-evolving beer industry;
Communicate confidently with fluent English skills;
Are proficient in Microsoft Office and comfortable using AI-based tools to support the work environment.
